# Deployment

## Standard (Vercel)

### Pre-Deploy
- [ ] CI tests passing
- [ ] PR merged to main

### Deploy
```bash
# Auto-deploys on merge
# Manual if needed:
vercel --prod
```

### Verify
- [ ] Health endpoint OK
- [ ] Run smoke tests
- [ ] Monitor 15 min

## With DB Migration

### Pre-Deploy
- [ ] Migration tested locally
- [ ] Backup exists

### Steps
```bash
npx prisma migrate deploy
npx prisma migrate status
vercel --prod
```
